<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ericsson is rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ericsson is rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen and Co said it initiated coverage of Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 at 35-1/4 in New York.</p>
